  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Reforma de la Gestin Pblica</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Public Management Reform Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El programa est dirigido a mejorar la eficiencia y eficacia de las instituciones del sector pblico en el gestin de los recursos. En particular, se busca apoyar el proceso de reforma de la administracin financiera del Estado que esta liderando la Secretara de Finanzas, tanto por el lado de la gestin del gasto como de la recoleccin y registro de los ingresos.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program would have the following action areas: support the implementation of strategies which would allow formal planning mechanisms for public investment, and follow-up and evaluation of public sector budget execution; (ii) support institutional reform to improve public finance information, simplify processes and reorganize the functional competencies at the Ministry of Finance; (iii) support high quality management training to enable human resources to identify new and efficient practices to lead changes in public resource management; y (iv) support the development and implementation of information and technical requirements requested by the economic cabinet for improved performance. Likewise, there would be support for administrative reforms in the institutions responsible for revenue collection, and for analysis of potential tax policy reform, which could be part of a fiscal pact for the country.</narrative>
  </description>
